        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Jingbang lunbg geimei Zion kailuang khou,",
            "Pou rui kajei hang 8#@ njan lou;",
            "Rianramei ruina muang kumma jing e,",
            "Ata kanloumei pu bam khuan ne.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "He nangniu Jerusalem mei nun,",
            "Njianloumei guai ta mu ri o ;",
            "Naomei guai ta tigailou ngam kan the,",
            "Njianloumei guai ta mu ri o.",
            "",
            "2. Jerusalem namdai rangbang khou 8#@,",
            "Amu ram thei 8#@ kaji ramme;",
            "Phangjao lo kalvari ching rukhou 8#@,",
            "Mei nun ding khou poubaumei hou e.",
            "",
            "3. Jaolo, Kalvari chingbut guang tang the,",
            "Tabui nung ai gwang tang nina cho ?",
            "He poubauhmei Nang gwangdat laknga cho?",
            "Nang bam khangmu Kalvari 8#@ e.",
            "",
            "4. Ai rui mulak khe poubauhmei Jisu,",
            "Kalvari ching 8#@ phang jao bamni;",
            "Akhang 8#@ rui khanglou mei alungh khou,",
            "Ai rui theimei nganna mulak khe."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
